(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - INDUSTRIES DEPARTMENT, GOVERNMENT OF MAHARASHTRA) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: CHIEF MINISTER EMPLOYMENT GENERATION PROGRAMME \(MAHARASHTRA\) \(CMEGP-MH\) / DIRECTORATE OF INDUSTRIES, MAHARASHTRA / KVIB / DISTRICT INDUSTRIES CENTRE \(DIC\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(State flagship credit-linked subsidy scheme for youth and micro-) Tj
T*
(entrepreneurs setting up manufacturing and service ventures in Maharashtra.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Domicile resident of Maharashtra state aged 18 to 45 years \(up to 50) Tj
T*
(   years for SC/ST/Women/Ex-servicemen\).) Tj
T*
(2. Minimum 7th standard pass for project cost up to Rs. 10 Lakh, and 10th) Tj
T*
(   standard pass for project cost above Rs. 10 Lakh.) Tj
T*
(3. Project must be located within the state of Maharashtra.) Tj
T*
(4. Only for new micro-enterprises in manufacturing \(up to Rs. 50 Lakh\) or) Tj
T*
(   service \(up to Rs. 20 Lakh\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. 15% to 35% capital subsidy \(margin money\) on project cost up to Rs. 50 Lakh) Tj
T*
(   for manufacturing and Rs. 20 Lakh for service units.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 35.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 17.5 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Maharashtra Domicile Certificate) Tj
T*
(2. Aadhaar Card and PAN Card) Tj
T*
(3. Educational qualification certificate) Tj
T*
(4. Detailed Project Report \(DPR\)) Tj
T*
(5. Caste / Special category certificate if claiming higher subsidy) Tj
T*
(6. Quotation of machinery / lease agreement for factory premises) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online via MahaCMEGP Portal) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://maha-cmegp.gov.in/) Tj
T*
ET
